                    Real Estate Executive Assistant/Transaction Coordinator



We are expanding! We are hiring multiple executive assistants to real estate agents in Silicon Valley, CA, USA. We use English as a working language for project and transaction coordination, email and calendar management, customer services, and lead generation.



Requirements:

- Fluent in reading, speaking and writing English;

- Good communication, fast learning skills and critical thinking;

- Working with patience and paying attention to details;

- Be able to work in a team environment. Willing to participate in meetings, training sessions and to help teammates complete tasks in an efficient and effective manner.



Duties:

- Communicate with clients via Email, phone, text, weChat and Zoom;

- Email and Calendar Management

- Transaction coordination for real estate files

- Efficient communication with clients to handle clients' request and follow procedures to help them resolve issues;

- Prepare, explain and help fill out related technical paperwork and documents;

- Prepare and/or translate marketing materials;

- Keep track of files and documents on shared folders

- Make cold and warm calls for lead generation

- Primary working language for all above items: English

